---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Tattoo Styles — Find Your Artist by Style
permalink: /style/
description: Browse tattoo artists by style — traditional, blackwork, fine-line, realism, Japanese, psychedelic, patriotic and more. Pick a style and find the best artist for the work you actually want.
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-inner">
    <p class="page-kicker">Browse by Style</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Find your artist by <span style="color:var(--gold-bright)">style</span></h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Pick the work you actually want — traditional, blackwork, fine-line, realism, psychedelic, patriotic and more.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="style-grid">
    {%- for s in collections.styleHubs %}
    <a class="style-card" href="/style/{{ s.slug }}/">
      <span class="style-card-name">{{ s.name }}</span>
      {%- if s.tagline %}<span class="style-card-tag">{{ s.tagline }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="style-card-count">{{ s.reviews.length }} artist{{ "s" if s.reviews.length != 1 }}</span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="prose hub-copy">
    <h2>Why browse by style instead of by name</h2>
    <p>
      Most people don't actually know which artist they want — they know which <em>tattoo</em> they
      want. They want fine-line botanicals, or a bold traditional eagle, or a black-and-grey
      portrait, or something psychedelic that looks like a vision. Style is the honest starting
      point, because the best artist for one style is rarely the best for all of them, and chasing a
      big name instead of the right specialist is how people end up disappointed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every artist we feature is tagged by the styles they genuinely specialize in. Click a style
      above to see the artists who own that lane, reviewed and ready to book, then cross it with your
      city using the <a href="/map/">interactive U.S. map</a>. Styles with no artist yet are open
      crowns — if that lane is your specialty, <a href="/get-reviewed/">claim it.</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

